From 96e9618b1125cde81e634bb11199b12b8d2159e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "James A. Holmes Jr." <Hollywoodsouth.eth@pm.me>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:33:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix settlement defects F1-F4; add tests, testnet deploy and
 smoke scripts

- withdraw settles both legs atomically (F1: a leg was stranded after the
  first withdraw)
- funded flag: no payout before the counterparty deposits (F2: unfunded
  withdraw paid from other swaps' deposits)
- refund/forceRefund return only deposited legs (F3)
- fundSwap runs once (F4)
- SafeERC20 for token legs, Address.sendValue for HBAR legs, reject native
  value on token legs
- Hedera: carbonMinted guard, admin setCarbonCreditNFT, minting disabled
  while the NFT is address(0)
- Same fixes in AtomicSwapV2_Eth
- 17 regression tests over both contracts (13 fail on the pre-fix code)
- scripts/deploy-hedera.js (hederaTestnet/296 only) records
  deployments/hedera-testnet.json; scripts/smoke-hedera.js runs one
  simulated create/fund/withdraw
- Docs: on-chain Chainlink price validation is not implemented

Pre-audit. Testnet only. Not for live value.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KvPBZ5bfJRbLkfZo3phMwK
