+
+## Test
+
+```
+npx hardhat test    # 17 settlement regression tests, both contracts
+```
+
+## Pre-audit settlement fixes (26 Sep 2026)
+
+| # | Finding | Fix |
+|---|---|---|
+| F1 | After one party withdrew, the other party's leg was locked forever | `withdraw` settles both legs in one transaction |
+| F2 | Initiator could withdraw the counterparty amount without it ever being funded, paid from other swaps' deposits | `funded` flag; `withdraw` requires it |
+| F3 | `refund` paid the counterparty amount even if never funded | Refund returns only deposited legs |
+| F4 | `fundSwap` accepted repeat funding; the extra was unrecoverable | `fundSwap` runs once |
+| n/a | Unchecked ERC-20 transfers; `transfer()` 2300-gas sends | `SafeERC20`; `Address.sendValue` |
+| n/a | Hedera carbon NFT could double-mint; no way to set the NFT after deploy | `carbonMinted` flag; admin `setCarbonCreditNFT` |
+
+These fixes are not a substitute for the independent security audit.
+
+## Deploy to Hedera testnet
+
+```
+cp .env.example .env          # HEDERA_PRIVATE_KEY = testnet ECDSA hex key
+npm run deploy:hedera-testnet # refuses any network but hederaTestnet (296)
+npm run smoke:hedera-testnet  # one simulated swap: create → fund → withdraw
+```
+
+HBAR amounts inside the Hedera EVM are tinybars (8 decimals). The JSON-RPC relay
+takes `value` in weibars (18 decimals): sending 1 HBAR means `value = 1e18` and an
+amount argument of `1e8`.
