+/**
+ * Settlement semantics (pre-audit fixes, 26 Sep 2026):
+ * - The counterparty funds exactly once (`funded`); nothing pays out before that.
+ * - withdraw() settles BOTH legs in one transaction: the initiator's asset to the
+ *   counterparty and the counterparty's asset to the initiator. Either party may
+ *   call it with the preimage. No leg can be left stranded.
+ * - refund()/forceRefund() return only what was actually deposited.
+ * - ERC-20 legs use SafeERC20; HBAR legs use Address.sendValue.
