+ * HBAR amounts are in tinybars (8 decimals) inside the contract. The JSON-RPC
+ * relay takes msg.value in weibars (18 decimals) and converts, so a caller sending
+ * 1 HBAR passes value = 1e18 but _initiatorAmount = 1e8.
+ *
+ * Not implemented: on-chain Chainlink price validation. See CLAUDE.md Known gaps.
